    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: on berlin a STOCHASTIC 'Blue Stochastic Platoon' (3 squads of 10; an authored table with LOSSES: the platoon's leaves 4-6 dead, 10-11 hurt at half health) holds (300,300); a PHYSICAL 'Red Patrol' parks 450 m north - inside the band, outside rifle reach. Judge (CE-8307): (1) the platoon splits into its 3 squads, each carrying its share of the losses - squad 1 its 3 dead and its hurt man, squad 2 its hurt man as its own leaf 1; (2) each squad splits into its men, the dead never created (squad 1: 7 men); (3) the instructor pins the platoon Stochastic at 60 s and the WHOLE tree merges back in one step - men into squads, squads into the platoon; (4) the platoon's table keeps every loss: exactly 3 down, the 2 hurt still at 12.5, 27 up. Fail: a loss healed or invented, a squad left over, a man re-created. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-platoon-merges-back"
  },
